Pair
├─ .Key    K              #                            (key)
│   └─ K is a type parameter; the walk stops until it is instantiated
└─ .Value  []V            #                            (value)
    └─ index .Value i  V  #   element i; range .Value  (value[i])
        └─ V is a type parameter; the walk stops until it is instantiated
